(alpha2-t5-rigid-probe)
*title Alpha 2 T5 synthetic rigid-body fidelity-ladder probe
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=1.0 reference-length=1.0 inertia-x=100 inertia-y=120 inertia-z=140 dry-mass-kg=1000 envelope-max-alpha-deg=20 envelope-max-beta-deg=20
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=50 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=180
*runtime status thermal policy=none

*trajectory 1 t5-rigid start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6379137 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=60 zdt=0 qw=0.7071067812 qx=0 qy=0 qz=0.7071067812 wx=0 wy=0 wz=0 time=0 mass=1000 propellant_mass=0
  *segment 1 ladder
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.05
    *prop thrust=0 mdot=0
    *aero cx=-0.02 cy=0 cz=-0.08 cmx=0.01 cmy=0.02 cmz=0.03
    *fly alpha=0
    *when time>2 stop
*end
